@archive 0017
@size 4

script 0 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
	"등록된 것 같아."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"첫 팀과 목표를\n정하니까 왠지\n뭉클하네."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Luna
	"자, 이제 “루나 포\n프레즈” 팀으로 활동을\n시작하자!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Bud
	"그런데 프레즈를\n학생회장으로 만들려면\n우리가 뭘 해야 하지?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Zack
	"음, 좋은 질문이야.\n프레즈, 뭘 하면 좋을까?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Luna
	"우선 이 학교에서\n곤란을 겪고 있는 아이들을"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"찾아서\n도와주자."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"물론 칭찬은\n내가 전부 받을 거야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그러면 내 지지율이\n하늘 높이 치솟겠지!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"키자마로!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"너한테 숫자 계산을\n잘하는 위저드가 있지?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그 녀석에게 내 지지율을\n계속 계산하게 해! 알겠지!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Zack
	"알겠어, 프레즈!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 1 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Zack
	"위저드 온!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 2 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Pedia
	"키자마로, 알려 줘서\n고마워!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"여러분, 제 이름은 페디아입니다!\n계산이라면 무엇이든\n저에게 맡겨 주세요!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Zack
	"페디아가 있으니\n우리 팀이 더 강해졌어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Pedia
	"제 데이터베이스에는\n방대한 지식이 들어 있습니다!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"게다가 모든\n순위와"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"백분율도 손쉽게\n계산할 수 있죠!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"계산하지 못할 수치는\n세상에 없습니다!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Bud
	"우와!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Luna
	"페디아, 정말 쓸모가 많겠네!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"*한숨*"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
	"그렇게 굴지 마, 워록!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"프레즈가 학생회장이 되면\n이 학교가 정말\n재미있어질 것 같아!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"정말 순진하구나, 꼬맹이..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
	"좋아! 곤란한 아이들을\n찾으러 가자!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Zack
	"응!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Bud
	"가자!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
